    "description": [
        false,
        "D21x is a high-performance full-HD display and intelligent control SoC, using a domestically produced 64-bit high-computing power RISC-V core. Built-in 16-bit DDR controller and provides rich interconnection peripheral interfaces, equipped with 2D image acceleration engine and H.264 decoding engine, It can meet various interactive design scenarios and multimedia interactive experiences, has high reliability, high security, and high openness design standards, and can be used in pan-industrial fields."
